  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "After decades of testing atomic bombs over sea, land, air, and even on
    people, humanity went further than ever before\u2014detonating them in outer
    space. What began as a small experiment would ultimately become their doom.\n\nAfter
    a failed launch, one bomb drifted directly toward Jupiter, Earth\u2019s natural
    shield. It imploded into a dazzling cloud of space dust visible from Earth. But
    after that beautiful explosion, everything changed. Meteors began passing near
    Earth more frequently than ever. In response, humanity united to build a colossal
    meteor-defense shield capable of instantly destroying incoming threats. Unfortunately,
    there was only enough material to construct part of it.\n\nHarnessing Earth\u2019s
    electric field, one man\u2014a true HERO\u2014controls the shield, intercepting
    any meteor or asteroid on a collision course. His mission: protect and save Earth,
    sometimes aided by mysterious UFOs. And all of this\u2026 simply because humanity
    couldn\u2019t resist playing with bombs again."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8a89fa14b10d46a99122fd4f73fca9a2, type: 2}
